exports[`CASE A — Character↔Character protected baseline > hug request contract is byte-stable: character cutout, portrait, ordered references 1`] = `"Full-body sequential-art character design. Hug: Mika and Ren. All participants occupy the same scene, at a consistent scale, from one viewpoint, with consistent lighting. Standing neutral pose, front view, whole body visible head to feet. Draw the character as clean monochrome black-and-white manga line art. Isolated single character, complete unbroken silhouette, nothing cropped. No scenery, no environment, no floor, no shadow on the ground, no frame, no border, no text, no speech bubbles. Place the character isolated on a pure solid white background (#FFFFFF). The background must be plain white everywhere: no coloured background, no gradient, no texture, no pattern, no scenery, no floor, and no cast shadow on the background. No coloured rim light, no glow, and no coloured outline around the character caused by the background. Keep a clean separation between the character and the white background. Project art style — Minimal Line Manga: Japanese sequential-art illustration, deliberate ink drawing, clear panel readability, minimal black-and-white manga drawing, very few confident ink lines, simplified anatomy, restrained facial features, flat composition, iconic readable silhouette, abundant negative space. Visual properties: colorMode: black-and-white, lineStyle: few confident lines, detailLevel: minimal, shading: almost none, rendering: flat iconic. Keep this visual language consistent across the project. Portrait orientation, 2:3 aspect ratio. Preserve Mika's exact face, hairstyle and proportions from reference image 1. Do not blend their features with anything else. Preserve Ren's exact face, hairstyle and proportions from reference image 2. Do not blend their features with anything else. Mika wears default outfit, unchanged. Ren wears default outfit, unchanged."`;
